  {
    "title": "Petting Farm",
    "route": "petting-farm",
    "og_title": "",
    "og_description": "",
    "body": "Chase, Highpark Steered Male Cow (Highland/ White Park, Black Tipped) Born 9/19/2024\nCowgirl, Highpark Female Cow (Highland/ White Park, Orange Tipped) Born 11/26/2024)\nTeddy, Male Mediterranean Mini Donkey, Born 5/30/2022\nPeaches, Female Mini Mediterranean Donkey, Born 3/21/2024\nLuna the Lamb, female, loves being brushed! Born April 2022\nMr. Wiggles, our little ram. He is gentle, sweet and loves little kids! Born February 2025.\nMia Female Nubian Goat, Born May 2023\nSprout, Male Nigerian Dwarf Goat, Born July 2021\nBean, Male Nigerian Dwarf Goat, Born July 2021. Sprouts brother.\nBethel, Mini Pygmy/ Nigerian Dwarf Female Goat. Born March 2023. Slater's Sister.\nOlaf, a beautiful goat. His mom is Blue Rowan, father Nubian/Alpine mix, Wether Male, Born 3/27/26\nAmy, all personality and a guest favorite. She is a Pygmy, borrn 3/29/25\nTucker, Turbo's twin brother, Alpine wether male Born 6/4/25\nTurbo, Tuckers twin, Alpine wether male goat, Born 6/4/25\nSheldon, Born March 27, 2025, Pygmy/ Nigerian Mix; In tact Billy goat\nRenegade, Born June 2025, Intact Male Boer Goat, Stud often kept at our home.\nWe have 30+ chickens who love visitors!\nRIP Slater, Male Mini Pygmy/ Nigerian Goat. Born with a crooked jaw. 3/23-2/26. Passed of cancer.",
    "images": [],
    "sections": [
      "Copy"
